[size=5][b][color=#4fc3f7]AI disclosure[/color][/b][/size]
Code, configuration and the translations were written with the help of Anthropic's Claude and reviewed before release. The dash sound effect was generated with ElevenLabs. No other generated assets are included, and no voice or likeness of any person is involved.

